    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d460">

                <pb facs="0356" n="306" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav03/pg306"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.77/605</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Morris</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-01-09T19:00:00+09:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 9,
                                1919, 7 p.m.</hi></date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 10.35 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Pursuant to Stevens’s telegram to Department. I have just accepted Japanese plan
                    and negotiations are satisfactorily closed here. Details follow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morris</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
